ss_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"UPIQcVZh5Bb_XloiNpSq0Q","review_id":"h5rZU79gm3PXz4vuUNtj6Q","date":"2016-08-04T02:07:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.951170027256012,"text_excerpt":"Second Line Brewery is legit! Tons of outdoor seating, food trucks come through, and they were playing \"Airplane\" on the big screen during my visit. The bar is just inside the massive garages doors that give the place a nice indoor/outdoor feel. You literally hang out next to the massive steel vats that they brew the beer in. It's a great space, it seems like they could throw some awesome parties here. Nice beer selection with something for every type of beer drinker."},{"business_id":"UPIQcVZh5Bb_XloiNpSq0Q","review_id":"TsrSGfWZLjA_cfaLt7NQXw","date":"2017-04-02T17:09:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9497972726821899,"text_excerpt":"I really like this brewery! It has a great atmosphere, very laid back, casual, and not pretentious. They have a variety of beers to choose from. You can try some of the beers they're experimenting with, as well. The people (workers and guests) are really nice and friendly. There is some indoor seating, but most of the seating is outdoors and there were two food trucks. The brewery is kid friendly and dog friendly, which contributes to the communal atmosphere. Of the new microbreweries open in NOLA, Second Line is my favorite so far!"},{"business_id":"UPIQcVZh5Bb_XloiNpSq0Q","review_id":"3V7tuHhvzxqdfyhOjE_3ow","date":"2018-10-29T15:51:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9398906230926514,"text_excerpt":"I go to Second Line Brewing all the time and I must say it is a completely awesome Mid-city spot. I had a great time there on Saturday where I was able to vist with some of my friends with children and little ones are welcome. For a brewery, this place has a great family atmosphere. It's not just a spot for drinking, they often host events such as movie nights, or bingo, they usually have a food truck or pop-up available for some delicious eats, they have toys for little ones, games for adults, and water bowls for the pups. That's not to mention the fact that the beer is great. They have a pretty solid variety for a new brewery and sometimes will even do a mixed drink special. This is a r..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"UPIQcVZh5Bb_XloiNpSq0Q","photo_id":"R9D8rNQGVAs4Bc3WsiaQZw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/R9D8rNQGVAs4Bc3WsiaQZw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8935617208480835},{"business_id":"UPIQcVZh5Bb_XloiNpSq0Q","photo_id":"d2yyPl2HW7wUZATvCZrmBw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/d2yyPl2HW7wUZATvCZrmBw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8590151071548462},{"business_id":"UPIQcVZh5Bb_XloiNpSq0Q","photo_id":"kDrAEQ3HgEXazmUDqWgJYQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/kDrAEQ3HgEXazmUDqWgJYQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8149434328079224}]},"notebook_case":null}
